---
title: "add (Sui Framework: dynamic_field)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_addr: object_addr = object.to_address()
    q_get_addr --> q_hash: hash = hash_type_and_key(object_addr, name)
    q_hash --> q_check_exists: has_child_object(object_addr, hash)
    q_check_exists --> q_abort: field already exists
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EFieldAlreadyExists
    q_check_exists --> q_create_field: no existing field
    q_create_field --> q_add_child: Field(uid_from_hash, name, value)
    q_add_child --> [*]: add_child_object(object_addr, field)

    note right of q_hash
        INV-001: field ID deterministic from hash(parent_id, name, Name_type)
        INV-002: uniqueness enforced by child object check before add
        INV-003: Name type is part of hash - different types for same key don't collide
    end note
